  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Peacebuilding from the ground up in Yemen&#x2019; project, implemented with three local partners YWBOD, NODS and PASS, aims to support civil society organisations and communities in Yemen, with a focus on women and youth, to work together with local authorities to address the root causes of conflict and insecurity and enable them to contribute to longer-term peace and security.</narrative>
